```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev A
    participant Git Repo
    participant Dev B
    
    Note over Dev A,Dev B: Collaborative Experiment Workflow
    
    Dev A->>Git Repo: git pull (get latest)
    Dev A->>Dev A: tofu apply experiment.aicl
    Note over Dev A: State: experiment.tfstate created/updated
    Dev A->>Git Repo: git add experiment.tfstate
    Dev A->>Git Repo: git commit -m "Exp: baseline"
    Dev A->>Git Repo: git push
    
    Dev B->>Git Repo: git pull
    Note over Dev B: Gets Dev A's experiment state
    Dev B->>Dev B: tofu apply experiment.aicl
    Note over Dev B: State: experiment.tfstate modified
    Dev B->>Git Repo: git add experiment.tfstate
    Dev B->>Git Repo: git commit
    Dev B->>Git Repo: git push
    
    Note over Git Repo: Conflict if concurrent
    
    Dev A->>Git Repo: git pull
    Note over Dev A: CONFLICT in experiment.tfstate
    Dev A->>Dev A: Resolve: rerun or merge
    Dev A->>Git Repo: git add experiment.tfstate
    Dev A->>Git Repo: git commit -m "Resolved"
    Dev A->>Git Repo: git push
    
    Note over Dev A,Dev B: Git provides explicit conflict resolution
```
